      <activity id="08158011-7b26-5764-ae52-53f330c425ab" activityNameId="a03a0b37-9efb-52f6-b705-241179564fe8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Meranti, standing, under bark, u=70%, in rainforest</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Meranti, standing, under bark, u=70%, in rainforest
data refers to wood 'under bark'. CO2 assimilation is based on 49.4% carbon in the wood including the bark (11%). Biomass energy equals gross calorific value including bark.\nTechnology: natural growth;
Synonyms: Shorea ssp., Seraya, Lauan; 
UUID: 550c5916-4525-311f-b41b-1e88d6a039e4
includes the CO2 absorption from air and the land use for the trees to grow (including 11% bark). Forest road area is not included in the land use; dataset refers to dark red meranti; Density: 600 kg/m3 (u=0)
Location: undefined
Technology: natural growth; relates to the forest area and CO2 from air needed to produce meranti
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_550c5916-4525-311f-b41b-1e88d6a039e4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
